{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50923","headline":"钓鱼 · 吕从庆","name":"钓鱼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"侵晨出门去，道遇村阿婆。\n问我一竿竹，得鱼日几何？\n我志不在鱼，毋问寡与多。\n行行至矶侧，卸我青草蓑。\n落花向我舞，啼鸟向我歌。\n旁有垂杨枝，迎风翻阿那。\n我意殊自得，翛然眠绿坡。\n仰视霄汉间，还以永吟哦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕从庆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50923.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50923","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}